[PrintTextModified Text:那之后的过程，<br>我已经不太记得了。|#0204Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多半是因为查明发生了凶杀案，<br>大家被叫到会客厅集合……|#0204Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多半是典狱长提出<br>要举行魔女审判……|#0204Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:于是在审判前的先行投票中我又一次获得最高票数，<br>直到审判开始前我都要被关押在惩罚室里。|#0204Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完全无法思考。|#0204Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在我的脑海里，<br>不断盘旋着<br>艾玛的尸体和蕾雅的尸体。|#0204Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛，死了……？）|#0204Adv13_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（蕾雅，死了……？）|#0204Adv13_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使是亲眼所见，<br>我也难以接受这就是现实。|#0204Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我还来不及向艾玛道歉……）|#0204Adv13_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我还有来不及对蕾雅说的话……）<br>|#0204Adv13_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:13_1 SubId:Middle

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#00000000 Duration:1.5 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

[PrintTextModified Text:不知不觉间，我已身处审判庭。|#0204Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:审判庭里少女们已经到齐了。|#0204Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:橘雪莉。<br>远野汉娜。|#0204Adv13_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:佐伯米莉亚。<br>紫藤亚里沙。|#0204Adv13_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Fearful1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:还有我……共五人。|#0204Adv13_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:直到那时我才终于意识到——<br>艾玛不在了，蕾雅不在了——已是事实。|#0204Adv13_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——她们，被杀了。|#0204Adv13_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经不在这个世界上的任何地方了。|#0204Adv13_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我环视周围的四名少女。|#0204Adv13_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（被杀了，被杀了，<br>　她们被杀了——！）|#0204Adv13_Hiro005|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的大脑仍然无法正常运作，<br>只有她们被杀死这个事实，正不断压垮我的胸口。|#0204Adv13_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（无论多么痛苦，<br>　也必须接受现实）|#0204Adv13_Hiro006|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我按住呼吸困难的胸口，<br>逼迫自己抬起头。|#0204Adv13_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不能被感情所控制。<br>必须让自己思考清晰。|#0204Adv13_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:因为只有这样，才能抵达真相。|#0204Adv13_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
